# Fireball throw test: spawn a fireball above the central prop, let it
# fall straight down, and verify the on-collision child cast
# (explosion_small) dispatches + impulses props within 3m of the impact.
#
# Move the observer well outside the explosion radius so the
# NetworkedPlayer (Dynamic body) doesn't itself get impulsed.
#
# Expected trace events:
#   - script_throw_fireball  (observer-1)
#   - spawn_body             (server, originating NetworkedProp net_id)
#   - cast_dispatched        (server, spell=explosion_small, kind=child)
#   - explosion_applied      (server, hits >= 1)
0.5  goto 0 1.5 -10
1.0  throw_fireball  0 5.0 0   0 -5.0 0
6.0  exit
